## Master formula sheet
- **Time-Weighted Rate of Return (TWRR):** `TWRR = [(1 + R1) * (1 + R2) * ... * (1 + Rn)] - 1` - SEBI mandated standard for reporting PMS portfolio performance, eliminating cash flow distortion.
- **AIF Waterfall Carried Interest:** `Carried Interest = 20% of (Net Profit - Hurdle Return)` - GP profit participation once LPs achieve preferred hurdle rate.

